Third-party components keep their own licenses:
- Leaflet (BSD-2-Clause), inlined in the build.
- Manrope and Space Mono fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1), inlined in the build.
- Map data: municipality and province boundaries by CBS/Kadaster via cartomap.github.io (CC BY 4.0);
  roads, rivers and districts © OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL);
  place names from GeoNames (CC BY 4.0); postcode centroids from the 4pp table (github.com/bobdenotter/4pp).
- Weather data at runtime: Open-Meteo (CC BY 4.0, KNMI model) and the national Buienradar radar image
  (used under Buienradar's terms with attribution; not redistributed).
